        {
          "id": 2254929573,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Looking at `tvb_get_fle()` a `NULL` would have a `prefix` with a value of 251 (0xFB) and not 0x00, so I don't think NULL and `0` get encoded the same way.\n\nAlso I can't think of a way where a `AUTO_INCREMENT` or `SELECT LAST_INSERT_ID(...)` would actually return a `NULL`, so this is difficult to test.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5884947,
            "username": "dveeden",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Daniël van Eeden",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/00c536bb5304097eb409787c4a770e820db2a200d04130b8ca03cbcda0f526f7?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/dveeden"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-12-12T08:10:45.772Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-12-12T12:31:00.279Z",
